<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><%- include('partials/head') %></head><body class="tl-body">
<%- include('partials/nav') %><main class="container-fluid px-3 px-lg-5 py-4">
<div class="tl-hero mb-4"><div><div class="tl-terminal-label">TRADERS LOG // PLAYBOOK</div><h1 class="display-6 fw-bold">STRATEGY <span class="tl-accent">LAB</span></h1><p class="tl-muted mb-0">A reference library covering trend, breakout, mean-reversion, price-action, liquidity, systematic and macro approaches.</p></div><div class="tl-badge-gold px-3 py-2 rounded-pill">EDUCATION MODE</div></div>
<div class="row g-3 mb-4" id="strategyGrid"></div>
<div class="row g-3"><div class="col-lg-6"><div class="tl-card p-4 h-100"><h5 class="tl-heading">DO</h5><ul class="tl-checklist"><li>Define entry, invalidation and target before entering.</li><li>Size the position from risk, not from desired profit.</li><li>Record the setup, context, execution and result.</li><li>Check spreads, liquidity and scheduled high-impact events.</li><li>Review a meaningful sample before changing a strategy.</li></ul></div></div><div class="col-lg-6"><div class="tl-card p-4 h-100"><h5 class="tl-heading">DON'T</h5><ul class="tl-checklist"><li>Don't treat scanner scores or news headlines as guarantees.</li><li>Don't move a stop farther away just to avoid a loss.</li><li>Don't revenge-trade or increase size after a losing streak.</li><li>Don't backtest with future information or survivorship bias.</li><li>Don't risk money you cannot afford to lose.</li></ul></div></div></div>
<div class="tl-card p-4 mt-3"><h5 class="tl-heading">RISK CHECKLIST</h5><div class="row g-2 small"><div class="col-md-3">☐ Market & timeframe aligned</div><div class="col-md-3">☐ Stop/invalidation defined</div><div class="col-md-3">☐ Position size calculated</div><div class="col-md-3">☐ News/event risk checked</div></div></div>
</main><script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/twitter-bootstrap/5.3.3/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script><script src="/js/strategies.js"></script><%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body></html>